  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0.6: with NLog 6, logger.Error(\"Order {OrderId} failed\", 42) lost its message template and logger.Error(\"Order {OrderId} failed: {Error}\", 42, exception) lost the exception: NLog 6 passes the arguments of these overloads as message template parameters, which the target reads now. An exception passed as a parameter is no longer repeated as a property. New attribute apiUrl, for a self-hosted BugsRadar only. The target keeps out only the package's own logger, BugsRadar.Client; your own BugsRadar.* loggers are reported now. Requires BugsRadar 3.0.0.6, which fixes the ILogger provider and the casing of property names. 3.0.0.5: no code changes; the author of the package is now BistriySpzoo, the same as the owner on nuget.org. 3.0.0.4: no code changes; the README and the package links point to the new documentation pages at bugsradar.com. 3.0.0.3: first version. The BugsRadar target for NLog: NLog.config or code, API key as a layout, or the client from DI with NLog.Extensions.Logging.",
